<h2 id=3D"AI-483-IntegrateConsulWatch-DevelopmentPlan">Development Plan</h2=
>
<p>To ensure a smooth transition, we'll follow this migration plan:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Deploy the Consul Watch sidecar alongside existing services without enab=
ling it (USE_CONSUL_WATCH=3Dfalse)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Update the AI+ Common library with the new detection logic and enhanceme=
nts</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enable the sidecar for a small subset of non-critical services in develo=
pment and staging</p></li>
<li>
<p>Monitor performance and resource usage metrics to ensure the approach is=
 working correctly</p></li>
<li>
<p>Gradually roll out to all services in production</p></li>
<li>
<p>Update documentation and developer guides to reflect the new approach</p=
></li>
</ol>
